---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import VideoGrid from '../components/VideoGrid.astro';

// ── HOW TO ADD A VIDEO ──────────────────────────────────────────────
// Fill in an item below. `vimeo` is the id from the URL:
//   https://vimeo.com/1192295930            →   vimeo: '1192295930'
//   https://vimeo.com/1192295930/ab12cd34   →   vimeo: '1192295930/ab12cd34'  (private/unlisted)
// Leave `vimeo` as '' to show a styled "Coming soon" placeholder tile.
// Only use REAL clients from the approved list. No invented names.
//
// THIS PAGE IS A BEST-OF, AND ITS JOB IS RANGE.
// One short piece per category, no client twice. The category pages
// (/business, /dance, /weddings) go deep; this page proves breadth.
// Rules that keep it working:
//   - Keep everything under ~90s. Nobody browses into a long film from a grid.
//     The 59-min recital and the 10-min Hawaii film stay on their own pages,
//     where their runtime is labelled and expected.
//   - Reusing a video that also appears on a category page is fine. What is
//     not fine is the same video twice on ONE page.
//   - Never ship a "Coming soon" tile here. An empty tile on a video
//     company's portfolio reads worse than a smaller grid.
//
// Held back on purpose: the second Elite Dance piece and the Nolensville
// season clip (dance is already represented), and the oncology patient
// welcome video (adds healthcare range but is the one piece we cannot
// currently attribute). Swap that in for the church tile if healthcare
// matters more than community work.
//
// GAP: there is no podcast video anywhere on the site, yet podcast production
// is one of three headline services on the homepage. The old "Coming soon"
// podcast tile was removed rather than advertise the hole.
// ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
const items = [
  // Leads deliberately: a recurring on-camera series for a named brokerage is
  // the core offering. Credits CBSR, not the individual agent.
  { title: 'Coldwell Banker Southern Realty', category: 'Agent on camera', vimeo: '1214149996' },
  { title: 'Tutoring Rocks', category: 'Brand video', vimeo: '707958942' },
  { title: 'Webb School Summer Camp', category: 'Education', vimeo: '1214150712' },
  { title: 'Nolensville Dance Company', category: 'Studio promo', vimeo: '1192295930' },
  { title: 'Parker and Andrew, sizzle reel', category: 'Wedding · 38 sec', vimeo: '1150766730' },
  { title: 'Church at Nolensville', category: 'Community event', vimeo: '1214151209' },
];
---
<Layout title="Portfolio | SDub Media Nashville" description="Work from SDub Media: corporate video, recurring content, weddings, and events in Nashville.">
<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Our work</span>
      <h1>Portfolio</h1>
      <p style="max-width: 560px; margin: 1rem auto 0;">One piece from each kind of work we do, for real clients around the Nashville area. More available on request, including full-length recital and wedding films.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 2rem;">
      <VideoGrid items={items} />
    </div>

    <p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 3rem; color: var(--muted);">
      Want to see more? <a href="/contact">Get in touch</a> and we'll send work that matches what you're planning.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
</Layout>
